 ```
 
+#### Browser push notifications (optional)
+
+Serve Fizzy over HTTPS and provide the same `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` and `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY` to the web app and its background job workers. Both keys must be set for the push controls to appear in Notification Settings. Keep the pair stable: existing browser subscriptions are tied to the public key.
+
+Users can then turn on push notifications in Notification Settings on each browser or installed web app where they want to receive their tray notifications.
+
 #### S3 storage (optional)
 
 If you'd prefer that uploaded files were stored in an S3 bucket rather than in your mounted volume, you can set that up.
